# ── OS junk ──────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# ── Editors / IDEs ───────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── Bun ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# package.json is scripts only and declares NO dependencies, so none of
# this should ever appear. These entries exist to keep it that way: if a
# dependency sneaks in, the install artefacts stay out of the repo and the
# "clone it and it runs" promise in CLAUDE.md doesn't quietly break.
node_modules/
bun.lock
bun.lockb
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml
*.log

# ── Verification scratch ─────────────────────────────
# Checking a change means rendering it (see the skills): test copies of a
# page or a stylesheet with the snap/height rules patched out. They are
# throwaway and must never be committed — the underscore prefix marks them.
# `blogs/_template.md` is deliberately NOT matched: it is .md, and it stays.
_*.html
_*.css

# ── Nothing is generated ─────────────────────────────
# There is no build step and no output directory. Posts are blogs/*.md,
# rendered in the browser; the landing list is drawn at run time. If you
# find yourself adding `dist/` here, something has gone wrong upstream.
